  "Organization": "Organization",
  "Data Infrastructure is the engineering foundation that organizes authorized information, keeps it consistent and makes it available to other SAVEN Core systems under clear limits.": "Infrastructure de données is the engineering foundation that organizes authorized information, keeps it consistent and makes it available to other SAVEN Core systems under clear limits.",
  "It exists so Human Data can move from raw information, through the Human Data Model that organizes it, toward the Knowledge Engine that provides consistent context. It does not choose vendors or define database products.": "It exists so Données humaines can move from raw information, through the Modèle de données humaines that organizes it, toward the Moteur de connaissances that provides consistent context. It does not choose vendors or define database products.",
  "SAVEN Core systems need shared, reliable access to authorized information.": "SAVEN Core systems need shared, reliable access to authorized information.",
  "Data Infrastructure defines how that information is organized, connected and made available under permissions and trust constraints.": "Infrastructure de données defines how that information is organized, connected and made available under permissions and trust constraints.",
  "The purpose is architectural clarity. The purpose is not to name tools, hosts or commercial platforms.": "The purpose is architectural clarity. The purpose is not to name tools, hosts or commercial platforms.",
  "Data Infrastructure is the set of engineering rules and structures that keep authorized information orderly and usable across SAVEN Core.": "Infrastructure de données is the set of engineering rules and structures that keep authorized information orderly and usable across SAVEN Core.",
  "It covers how information is grouped, how relationships are kept, and how other systems may request access when allowed.": "It covers how information is grouped, how relationships are kept, and how other systems may request access when allowed.",
  "It does not mean a specific database, file store, cloud provider or software vendor.": "It does not mean a specific database, file store, cloud provider or software vendor.",
  "Think of it as the shared foundation beneath Human Data, the Human Data Model and later knowledge layers—not as a product catalog.": "Think of it as the shared foundation beneath Données humaines, the Modèle de données humaines and later knowledge layers—not as a product catalog.",
  "Information organization means grouping authorized facts so they stay understandable over time.": "Information organization means grouping authorized facts so they stay understandable over time.",
  "Groups should match the purposes already defined for Human Data and the Human Data Model.": "Groups should match the purposes already defined for Données humaines and the Modèle de données humaines.",
  "Organization also means knowing what must stay separate. Sensitive categories should not be casually joined.": "Organization also means knowing what must stay separate. Sensitive categories should not be casually joined.",
  "This page describes those rules at the architecture level. It does not describe tables, schemas or storage formats.": "Cette page describes those rules at the architecture level. It does not describe tables, schemas or storage formats.",
  "Human Data is information about a person from different sources.": "Données humaines is information about a person from different sources.",
  "Data Infrastructure does not invent that information. It provides the shared foundation that can hold and move authorized Human Data under limits.": "Infrastructure de données does not invent that information. It provides the shared foundation that can hold and move authorized Données humaines under limits.",
  "Without clear infrastructure rules, Human Data risks becoming scattered, duplicated or used outside its purpose.": "Without clear infrastructure rules, Données humaines risks becoming scattered, duplicated or used outside its purpose.",
  "For what Human Data means as information, read the Human Data page.": "For what Données humaines means as information, read the Données humaines page.",
  "The Human Data Model is the structured representation that organizes Human Data and preserves context and relationships.": "The Modèle de données humaines is the structured representation that organizes Données humaines and preserves context and relationships.",
  "Data Infrastructure supports that model. It helps keep the organized view available to systems that are allowed to use it.": "Infrastructure de données supports that model. It helps keep the organized view available to systems that are allowed to use it.",
  "The model defines the structure. Data Infrastructure supports reliable access to that structure under permissions.": "The model defines the structure. Infrastructure de données supports reliable access to that structure under permissions.",
  "For how the model organizes information, read the Human Data Model page.": "For how the model organizes information, read the Modèle de données humaines page.",
  "The Knowledge Engine is a system layer that organizes knowledge and provides consistent context to other components. It does not make independent decisions.": "The Moteur de connaissances is a system layer that organizes knowledge and provides consistent context to other components. It does not make independent decisions.",
  "Data Infrastructure gives the Knowledge Engine a dependable base for authorized information and relationships.": "Infrastructure de données gives the Moteur de connaissances a dependable base for authorized information and relationships.",
  "The Knowledge Engine uses that base to keep context consistent. It does not replace privacy rules, human oversight or the Human Data Model.": "The Moteur de connaissances uses that base to keep context consistent. It does not replace privacy rules, human oversight or the Modèle de données humaines.",
  "A dedicated Knowledge Engine page is not published yet. This section states the architectural relationship only.": "A dedicated Moteur de connaissances page is not published yet. This section states the architectural relationship only.",
