  "It matters in SAVEN Core because later layers—such as the Knowledge Engine and AI Decision Support—should use organized context, not informal views of a person. Those layers support human review. They do not replace human judgment.": "It matters in SAVEN Core because later layers—such as the Moteur de connaissances and Aide à la décision par IA—should use organized context, not informal views of a person. Those layers support human review. They do not replace human judgment.",
