  "Keeps laboratory-related context as a separate sensitive group—not a laboratory service.": "Keeps laboratory-related context as a separate sensitive group—not a laboratory service.",
  "Keeps hereditary context under the strictest separation and purpose limits if ever authorized.": "Keeps hereditary context under the strictest separation and purpose limits if ever authorized.",
  "Groups daily-life context that may support continuity of assistance without open profiling.": "Groups daily-life context that may support continuity of assistance without open profiling.",
  "Groups surrounding conditions that may change how human context is interpreted when permitted.": "Groups surrounding conditions that may change how human context is interpreted when permitted.",
