  "Privacy limits exposure of human context. Broad secondary use is outside the model’s purpose.": "Privacy limits exposure of human context. Broad secondary use is outside the model’s purpose.",
  "Trust constraints connect privacy, security, safety and human data so permissions stay cross-cutting.": "Trust constraints connect privacy, security, safety and human data so permissions stay cross-cutting.",
